{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_04_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1084205972d45b20f6e80f37579fe732b64279d30fb1fd469e966addbfad77eb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7360d36e34b3334413d47865b6daaaa6bf8aad8a988ec393d94aff9e525d04c",
      "text": "说到我们的特长，那就是那个了吧。\n虽说根本用不着练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb6207d87491cc9ca3dae17591ad55426774fd78bc7ea5e3acb48688d3c4a03",
      "text": "天空朱雀落！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11fe667fc62f5a21501ce8a9f48e0fdbce5c73098d3e033ac35b2abf3aabdb56",
      "text": "天玄冰刃波！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11594551f448f067ed0bedeccb65b539d2e21ad4b55997ffda262de85058271a",
      "text": "哇喔！？怎么了，\n出什么事了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5bb0bf589521dfe32f379117e47bec01fdf1e16d3c131eeace4970fe588c35",
      "text": "噢，你们在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76595177befc6714c0c49cf751d454189610ed88f683d2eec9cf8fc7117fa722",
      "text": "要去和哪个高中的干架吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afb2106ddd7aa072a83fce52a14d57135a7ce77fdf9ec5703d91e16735b90bf1",
      "text": "不。……也没什么好瞒的。我们要去参加\n偶像的试镜。在为此做练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be8a395d0180507b13f2b14108a7d328c352084d0a4b02c08ae69f36330c0a33",
      "text": "试镜！？最近一直在打听偶像的事，\n原来是为了这个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61201809267611a405db52a1fb125b411e887e2faa18e8ce493a7fbe56ee48aa",
      "text": "嘿嘿，算是吧。\n详细情况回头再跟你们说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ba1bf913ce57a6ba601cf478efbef3f6abb494d72dd1cfcf9eff90d613b8c1",
      "text": "你们知道吗？不良少年和偶像，\n可是有共同点的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
